# odds gate wrapper sweep, 2026-10-19

For docs/CC-CMD-2026-10-18-odds-gate-reads-wrapper-bodies.md, item 3.
Source: the single-batch branch at its review-fix head, extracted with
`git archive`. No network, and RELAY_SHARED_SECRET unset.

Population: `ls scripts | grep -E '^check-.*\.(mjs|js|sh)$' | grep -iE
'odds|budget|month|ceiling|degrade|charge|batch|quota'`, which gives 27
scripts. **Checked 26 of 27.** The 27th, check-odds-fallback-binding-type.sh,
calls the Cloudflare API and was not run.

Each was run four times: on clean source, then with one wrapper's
`return chargeOdds(env, units, site);` replaced by `return true;`. That
replacement was made in src/index.js consumeOddsCredit, src/wp-resolver.js
consumeOddsCredit, and src/ambient-do.js _consumeAmbientOddsCredit (anchor
asserted unique). Columns are exit codes.

Result: only check-monthly-atomic.mjs changes rc (0 to 1), for each of the
three wrappers. Every other check passes a gutted wrapper.

